    "details": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"26\" data-end=\"84\"><strong>Anveshan</strong> is organising Not another &ldquo;make a PPT and call it innovation&rdquo; hackathon.</p>\n<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"178\">Forged in Fire 2026 is all about building stuff that actually works &mdash; hosted at BPIT, Delhi.</p>\n<p data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"197\"><strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"197\">Online Round: </strong>21 October 2026&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"237\"><strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"237\">Offline Finale: </strong>24 October 2026</p>\n<p data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"273\"><strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"273\">Prize Pool: </strong>₹10,000</p>\n<p data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"294\"><strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"294\">Venue: </strong>BPIT, Delhi</p>\n<p data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"326\"><strong data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"326\">How It Works:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"349\"><strong data-start=\"328\" data-end=\"349\">Round 1 &mdash; Online:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"398\">Don't have a fully polished product? Who cares.</li>\n<li data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"413\">Just show us:</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u14in\" data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"444\">Your technical architecture</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"90b0lm\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"471\">A working demo/prototype</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xon49w\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"520\">What you're building + why it actually matters</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"601\">If your tech is solid and your demo works, you're through to the offline round.</li>\n<li data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"645\">No unnecessary 50-slide pitch deck energy.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"676\"><strong data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"676\">Round 2 &mdash; Offline Finale:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"712\">Qualified? Now you're in the fire.</li>\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"812\">Come to BPIT on 29 October, build further, break things, fix them, and ship your final solution.</li>\n<li data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"906\">And yes &mdash; every team that qualifies gets a FREE n8n account to use during the offline round.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"929\"><strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"929\">Pick Your Battle:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"958\"><strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"958\">n8n Sponsored Track:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"980\">Automate everything.</li>\n<li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1132\">Build crazy-good workflows using n8n &mdash; AI automation, agentic workflows, integrations, data pipelines, autonomous processes, whatever you can cook up.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1202\">If it involves AI + automation + workflows, you're probably cooking.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1225\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1225\">Agentic Track:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1264\">Chatbots are cool. Agents are cooler.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1337\">Build systems that can actually think &rarr; plan &rarr; use tools &rarr; take action.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1457\">Multi-agent systems, coding agents, research agents, AI assistants, agent orchestration, autonomous systems &mdash; go wild.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1482\"><strong data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1482\">Open Innovation:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1514\">No box. No predefined problem.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1562\">Got an idea that doesn't fit the other tracks?</li>\n<li data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1573\">Build it.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1694\">FinTech, Cybersecurity, Web3, EdTech, HealthTech, AI, DevTools, Sustainability, IoT &mdash; whatever problem you wanna solve.</li>\n<li data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1751\">If it's innovative and actually works, we wanna see it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1768\"><strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1768\">Team Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"2326\">\n<li data-section-id=\"10n7zcq\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1797\">Inter-college teams? YES.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xpsu5e\" data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1840\">Different branches/specializations? YES.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8x3ns3\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1875\">Mix your skills. Build together.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ch6rsz\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1910\">Pick one track for your project.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vzu7at\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1953\">Your project should be your team's work.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10brmtv\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2010\">Open-source tools, APIs, frameworks, etc. are allowed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"121yijz\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2092\">Don't pull a Ctrl+C &rarr; Ctrl+V on someone else's project. Plagiarism = instant L.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fxik2j\" data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2157\">Online round requires a working demo + technical architecture.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jn1wb1\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2216\">Qualifying teams must attend the offline finale at BPIT.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ecytb2\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2297\">Judges will evaluate tech, architecture, innovation, execution, impact &amp; demo.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2vkd1p\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2326\">Judges' decision is final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2354\"><strong data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2354\">What's in It for You?:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2535\">\n<li data-section-id=\"ikdyn8\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2376\">₹10,000 Prize Pool</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"b2ue6q\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2413\">Goodies for participants + winners</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f59f9j\" data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2450\">FREE FOOD during the offline round</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"e1jrm6\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2499\">FREE n8n account for every team that qualifies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6m5cr7\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2535\">Build with other cracked builders</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2547\"><strong data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2547\">TL;DR:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2725\">\n<li data-section-id=\"8iyo49\" data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2594\">21 OCT &rarr; Build + Show us your tech online.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pumjyj\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2627\">You qualify &rarr; FREE n8n account</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dd542f\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2655\">24 OCT &rarr; Pull up to BPIT</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4003as\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2682\">Build. Break. Fix. Ship.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12mwff0\" data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2725\">WIN ₹10,000 + goodies + bragging rights.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2750\"><strong data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2750\">Don't overthink it:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2785\">You don't need a perfect product.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2871\">You just need something that works, has a solid technical backbone, and makes us go:</p>\n<p data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2871\">&ldquo;Okay&hellip; these guys are cooking.&rdquo;</p>",
